            {
                "recipe_order": 9,
                "step": "Dispense the medium into the culture vessels. For small volumes serum bottles or Hungate tubes may be used. The gas phase to liquid ratio should be about 1:10. Use a gas phase containing air, 20-30% methane and autoclave at 121\u00b0C for 15 minutes. When the growth medium is cool the phosphate buffer is added."
            },
            {
                "recipe_order": 10,
                "step": "Autoclave at 121\u00b0C for 15 min."
            },
            {
                "recipe_order": 11,
                "step": "Add to the sterile medium from a filter sterilised phosphate buffer: "
            },
